proof_authority.educational.lessons.2.title — text — Value Lesson 3 — Title — Short lesson title
proof_authority.educational.lessons.2.main_topic — text — Value Lesson 3 — Main Topic — The main topic covered
proof_authority.educational.lessons.2.common_challenge — textarea — Value Lesson 3 — Common Challenge — The common challenge addressed
proof_authority.educational.lessons.2.core_insight — textarea — Value Lesson 3 — Core Insight — The core insight of the lesson
