exports[`registry baseline (Coach-facing) > structure prompt is unchanged 1`] = `
"# Business Blueprint structure (generated from the Blueprint Registry)
The Business Blueprint module has these tabs and sub-blocks:
- Customer Clarity (tab id: customer_clarity, JSON column: customer_clarity)
  - Ideal Client Avatar (avatar) — 4 field(s)
  - Pain & Friction (pain) — 4 field(s)
  - Desire & Goals (desire) — 3 field(s)
  - Transformation (transformation) — 3 field(s)
- Offer Design (tab id: offer_design, JSON column: offer_stack)
  - Offer Angle (angle) — 13 field(s), lists: Framework Pillars
  - Offer Stack (stack) — 2 field(s), lists: Core Deliverables, Templates & Resources, Support System, Bonuses, Delivery Milestones
  - Pricing (pricing) — 4 field(s), lists: Payment Plans
  - Offer Ecosystem (ecosystem) — 0 field(s)
- Brand Strategy (tab id: brand_strategy, JSON column: brand_strategy)
  - Positioning (positioning) — 4 field(s)
  - Brand Voice (voice) — 3 field(s)
  - Visual Direction (visual) — 3 field(s)
  - Brand Foundation (foundation) — 3 field(s)
- Authority & Content (tab id: proof_authority, JSON column: proof_authority)
  - Authority (authority) — 4 field(s)
  - Social Proof (social_proof) — 0 field(s), lists: Credibility Metrics, Client Results, Testimonials, Authority Assets
  - Stories & Lessons (stories) — 0 field(s), lists: Founder Stories, Value Lessons"
`;

